 "cause": {
  "type": "interview",
  "correction_id": "A-COR-0005",
  "rule_id": "A-R-007",
  "note": "Don't carry it forward. First check whether the slip covers several count sheets combined. If it still doesn't tie to anything, treat it as an unidentified deposit: under $50 goes to 4990 misc income, and $50 or more goes to me (the owner), not the ops manager. The ops manager only gets count-sheet differences over $20 on deposits we can match.",
  "explanation": "The controller answered the open question on A-R-007 and also set the ops manager's threshold. That gives four changes:\n1. A-R-007 said unmatched branch deposits go to the ops manager. They said they don't, and they aren't carried forward either. A-R-007 now covers only unidentified deposits under $50, which are booked to 4990 Misc income.\n2. A new rule sends unidentified branch deposits of $50 or more to the owner. It is inserted just before A-R-008, so it sits right after A-R-007 and after all the matching rules.\n3. The ops manager now gets only count-sheet differences over $20 on deposits we can match, so A-R-006's threshold drops from $25.28 to $20.00. The controller said \"differences\", not shortages, so the rule now covers overages as well as shortfalls. The rule language can't state \"more than $20 either way\" directly. Instead the rule depends on A-R-005 running first and taking differences up to $20.\n4. A-R-005 drops from $25.28 to $20.00. Without that, differences between $20 and $25.28 would still be written off to 6990 before they could reach the ops manager.\nThe check for \"several count sheets combined\" is already covered by approved rule A-R-004 (exact sum of up to 4 collection entries). The new wording \"one or several\" in A-R-005 and A-R-006 carries that check into the difference cases. All four changed rules are non-executable, because matching deposits to count sheets with differences isn't executable. The unidentified-deposit rules only apply once matching has failed, so they stay non-executable too; otherwise they could book a deposit that simply has a difference against its count sheets.",
  "patch": {
   "kind": "ops",
   "ops": [
    {
     "op": "modify",
     "rule_id": "A-R-005",
     "executable": false,
     "text": "A branch cash deposit, not a mobile check deposit, that differs from one or several route cash collection entries in 4000 Vending sales by up to $20.00 is matched with the difference booked to 6990 Cash over/short and small balances.",
     "when": {
      "item_kind": "bank",
      "direction": "in",
      "description_regex": "^(?!.*MOBILE).*(CASH DEP|BRANCH DEP|DEPOSIT)",
      "candidate": {
       "by": "amount_near",
       "window_days": 7,
       "account": "4000",
       "max_entries": 4
      },
      "diff_abs_max": 20
     },
     "then": {
      "action": "match_adjust",
      "account": "6990"
     }
    },
    {
     "op": "modify",
     "rule_id": "A-R-006",
     "executable": false,
     "text": "A branch cash deposit, not a mobile check deposit, that differs from one or several route cash collection entries in 4000 Vending sales by more than $20.00 goes to the ops manager.",
     "when": {
      "item_kind": "bank",
      "direction": "in",
      "description_regex": "^(?!.*MOBILE).*(CASH DEP|BRANCH DEP|DEPOSIT)",
      "candidate": {
       "by": "amount_near",
       "window_days": 7,
       "account": "4000",
       "max_entries": 4
      }
     },
     "then": {
      "action": "escalate",
      "escalate_to": "ops_manager"
     }
    },
    {
     "op": "modify",
     "rule_id": "A-R-007",
     "executable": false,
     "text": "A branch cash deposit under $50.00 that cannot be tied to one or several route cash collection entries in 4000 Vending sales is booked to 4990 Misc income as an unidentified deposit.",
     "when": {
      "item_kind": "bank",
      "direction": "in",
      "description_regex": "^DEPOSIT BR \\d+ SLIP",
      "amount_max": 49.99
     },
     "then": {
      "action": "book",
      "account": "4990"
     }
    },
    {
     "op": "add",
     "insert_before": "A-R-008",
     "executable": false,
     "text": "A branch cash deposit of $50.00 or more that cannot be tied to one or several route cash collection entries in 4000 Vending sales goes to the owner as an unidentified deposit.",
     "when": {
      "item_kind": "bank",
      "direction": "in",
      "description_regex": "^DEPOSIT BR \\d+ SLIP",
      "amount_min": 50
     },
     "then": {
      "action": "escalate",
      "escalate_to": "owner"
     },
     "assigned_id": "A-R-017"
    }
   ],
   "origin": "interview A-COR-0005"
  }
 }
